  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "DFNDR-2B",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Card for DFNDR-2B\n\t\n\n\n\nThis dataset contains synthetic captions, embeddings, and metadata for DFNDR-2B.\nThe metadata has been generated using pretrained image-text models on DFN-2B, a 2B filtered subset of DataComp-12B.\nFor details on how to use the metadata, please visit our ml-mobileclip repository.\nFor code to generate multi-modal reinforced datasets at large scale see ml-mobileclip-dr repository.\nNote that this release does not contain original ground-truth captions. Please\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/apple/DFNDR-2B.",
